# Photos and video in a thread and on a call, over invented answers: ANSWERS=scripts/duo-media.json HEX=kept scripts/duo tap <ref> scripts/duo-media-taps
# The simulator has no camera: its drawer shows black, and its shutter makes a still of its own.
